! The ten-site silicon supercell with an **ultrasoft** LDA dataset: the two-grid
! split, the augmentation charge and the self-consistent `D_ij` at ten sites.
! `ecutwfc = 20` with a dual of 8 is `si8-us.in`'s choice, for its reasons -- the
! dual has to exceed 4 or the augmentation charge is not representable on the
! density grid.
 &control
    calculation = 'scf'
 /
 &system
    ibrav = 0, celldm(1) = 10.20, nat = 10, ntyp = 1,
    ecutwfc = 20.0, ecutrho = 160.0
 /
 &electrons
    conv_thr = 1.0d-10
 /
CELL_PARAMETERS alat
  -0.50  0.00  0.50
   0.00  0.50  0.50
  -2.50  2.50  0.00
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 Si  28.086  Si.pz-n-rrkjus_psl.0.1.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS (alat)
 Si    0.0000    0.0000    0.0000
 Si    0.2500    0.2500    0.2500
 Si   -0.5000    0.5000    0.0000
 Si   -0.2500    0.7500    0.2500
 Si   -1.0000    1.0000    0.0000
 Si   -0.7500    1.2500    0.2500
 Si   -1.5000    1.5000    0.0000
 Si   -1.2500    1.7500    0.2500
 Si   -2.0000    2.0000    0.0000
 Si   -1.7500    2.2500    0.2500
K_POINTS automatic
 4 4 1 0 0 0
